## FCMChatWidget build file
## Modern child-widget build; the legacy standalone bridge has its own compile path.
## Run from the hudmodloader-chat/ directory (or adjust paths).
##
## Prerequisites: Haxe 4.3+
## Build: haxe build.hxml
## Then normalize: python3 normalize_swf.py FCMChatWidget.swf (see BUILD.md).

--main FCMChatWidget
--class-path ..
--swf FCMChatWidget.swf
--swf-version 32

# Fallout GFx does not guarantee Flash Player 11 native JSON.
-D haxeJSON
